e movie produced by Toei Animation.  The movie was released in Japanese cinemas on October 31, 2015. It consists of 3 features; A Precious Treasure of Pumpkin Land, Lefy's Wonderful Night, and Cure Flora and A Mysterious Mirror.","tagline":"A Precious Treasure Of Pumpkin Land"},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"新しくオープンした『パンプキンカフェ』でたのしくスウィーツを楽しむはるか、みなみ、きらら、トワの4人。ふと店内で目にした『パンプキン王国　プリンセス大会』に興味をひかれていると、ゼツボーグが現れて、プリキュアたちはパンプキン王国へと迷い込んでしまう……。\r そこには、何か大切なことを忘れてしまっているパンプキン王国の王と后、彼らに仕えるウォープ大臣の姿が。\r 実は、そこには消えたプリンセス、パンプルル姫の秘密が隠されていた――\r プリキュアたち４人がちからを合わせて、パンプキン王国の“大切なたからもの”を取り戻します。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qORMjA4Pw3VgvNnUFmpeWTaLBDg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qORMjA4Pw3VgvNnUFmpeWTaLBDg.jpg","language":"xx","width":680,"height":963}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lI48RrNUgONd8bJq6aSHKV720Xm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lI48RrNUgONd8bJq6aSHKV720Xm.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720}]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qORMjA4Pw3VgvNnUFmpeWTaLBDg.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lI48RrNUgONd8bJq6aSHKV720Xm.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lI48RrNUgONd8bJq6aSHKV720Xm.jpg","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt6449862/img"},"episodes":[{"link":"99897","sourcePath":"/play/go-princess-pretty-cure-il-film-cure-flora-e-lo-specchio-dispettoso.U6udM/Lf6Ruw","sourceEpisodeNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":"Go! Princess PreCure the Movie: Go! Go!! Splendid Triple Feature!!!","synopsis":"The Pumpkin Kingdom's Treasure Good day! I am Haruno Haruka! We went to a fairyland country called Pumpkin Kingdom after the cafe we were in teleported us there! However, the princess of the country was found to be missing!! Pretty Cure and Refi's Wonder Night! We are then flown to a country known as the Pumpkingdom, which is sentenced with an eternal nighttime by darkness by Night Pumpkin! Cure Flora and the Mischievous Mirror An excited Cure Flora is holding nice hair ornaments in her hands. As she carefully opens the hair ornaments, a curtain immediately opens up, resulting in Cure Flora coughing away the dust. When the dust settles down, a mirror is seen before her but the Cure Flora in the mirror is making a strange face....","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/291565/episodes/5f74b189b2e0a.jpg","externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11341","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21323","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt6449862","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"mal","id":"29868","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"393528","episodeNumbers":[1]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"291565","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"metadataSources":{"tvdb":{"title":"Go! Princess PreCure the Movie: Go! Go!! Splendid Triple Feature!!!","synopsis":"The Pumpkin Kingdom's Treasure Good day! I am Haruno Haruka! We went to a fairyland country called Pumpkin Kingdom after the cafe we were in teleported us there! However, the princess of the country was found to be missing!! Pretty Cure and Refi's Wonder Night! We are then flown to a country known as the Pumpkingdom, which is sentenced with an eternal nighttime by darkness by Night Pumpkin! Cure Flora and the Mischievous Mirror An excited Cure Flora is holding nice hair ornaments in her hands. As she carefully opens the hair ornaments, a curtain immediately opens up, resulting in Cure Flora coughing away the dust. When the dust settles down, a mirror is seen before her but the Cure Flora in the mirror is making a strange face....","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}}},{"link":"99898","sourcePath":"/play/go-princess-pretty-cure-il-film-cure-flora-e-lo-specchio-dispettoso.U6udM/meGKkd","sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"episodeNumber":2,"title":"The Pumpkin Kingdom`s Treasure","synopsis":"Puff and Aroma explain to Haruka, they got separated from Kanata after the Hope Kingdom was attacked by Dys Dark, led by a witch named Dyspear, entrusted with finding the three Princess PreCures who possess the Dress Up Keys. As Haruka decides to train hard to become a proper princess, student council president Minami Kaidou finds a Dress Up Key washed up on the beach. After observing Minami's graceful elegance, Haruka asks her to teach her how to do ballet so that she can become more princess-like. Despite the strictness of the lessons, Haruka continues to work hard, only to end up spraining her ankle whilst attempting an advanced move. While treating her injury, Minami confesses that she is far from perfect, only possessing her ballet skills from training hard as a kid, expressing her joy that someone asked her for lessons. Later, as Close targets a boy yearning to be a soccer star to create a Trophy Zetsuborg, Minami spots Haruka transforming into Cure Flora as she goes to fight against it. With Haruka's sprained ankle leaving her at a disadvantage, Minami's desire to protect her gives her the ability to transform into Cure Mermaid and defeat the Zetsuborg. Just as Haruka and Minami are about to celebrate their new partnership, Puff and Aroma discover that the third Princess Perfume in their possession has gone missing.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/291565/5117670.jpg","externalMappings":[]},{"link":"99899","sourcePath":"/play/go-princess-pretty-cure-il-film-cure-flora-e-lo-specchio-dispettoso.U6udM/A6xvrn","sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"episodeNumber":3,"title":"Precure and Refi`s Wonder Night!","synopsis":"While Minami works with Puff and Aroma to find the missing Princess Perfume, Haruka joins the rest of the freshmen in cleaning the dorms. However, Puff gets discovered by the dorm superviser, Reiko Kisaragi, who states that pets can't be kept in the dorm. After studying the rules, which requires every student to agree in order to implement a new rule, Minami gives Haruka one week to unanimously convince the other students to let Puff stay in the dorms. Over the week, Haruka manages to use Puff's charms to convince almost everyone, with the exception of Kisaragi, who doesn't get along well with dogs. Before Haruka can think of a solution, Dys Dark's second emmissary, Shut, targets a karate practitioner to create a Karate Zetsuborg. As the PreCure fight against the Zetsuborg, Puff leads Kisaragi to safety, only to run into Close wielding his own Zetsuborg. Puff risks herself to protect Kisaragi until Haruka and Minami arrive and defeat both Zetsuborgs. Thankful for Puff's efforts, Kisaragi makes the vote to keep her magnanimous, allowing her to stay in the dorms. Meanwhile, another student in the dorms is seen with the Princess Perfume.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/291565/5117671.jpg","externalMappings":[]}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-11-02T08:43:20Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:21323","mal:29868"],"imdbSource":"anibridge-v3","targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10941","scope":"R"},{"provider":"anidb","id":"11341","scope":"R","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21137"},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21323","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt5447070"},{"provider":"imdb_movie","id":"tt6449862","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"28511"},{"provider":"mal","id":"29868","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"315022"},{"provider":"tmdb_movie","id":"393528","ranges":{"1":"1"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"291565","scope":"s0","ranges":{"1":"2"}}]},"artworkInventory":{"logo":[{"source":"cinemeta","url":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt6449862/img"},{"source":"anizip","url":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/series/291565/clearlogo/673d1e51cd0b4.png"}],"poster":[{"source":"tmdb","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qORMjA4Pw3Vgv